  "method": "Top-down actual large a/b/c clumps, unlit photographed dry albedo, actual geometry/photo normals and fixed roughness; periodic world placements; linear-light 2x colour downsample and renormalized normals. RGB16 PNG decoded to high-byte RGB8; official separate Alpha16 converted to high-byte Alpha8. Underlay uses existing CC0 Withered Grass scan (dry-field-source.json). Separate sRGB/linear render targets, flat-normal calibration. PNG row zero is world +Z for runtime ground flipY=true and worldXZ UVs; normal RGB is world X/Z/up. No sun or backdrop baked.",
